    "event": "pull_request",
    "head_branch": "chore/seek-gather-native",
    "head_commit_message": "perf(formation): the native seek's gathering works out each squad's say once\n\nScrumSeekField._gather turned each seeker's squad frame again for every\nunit (ScrumStance.anchor -> SquadFrame.place -> UnitMotion.vector) and\nasked _may_seek, the squad's order and its chasers unit by unit. It now\nworks out a squad's foes, front band, frame and retreat once, and places\neach unit in the frame with SquadFrame.place_in - place()'s own\nexpression, which a test holds bit for bit to place(). The same units,\nanchors and flags go to the core.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E3rJWSqvkcCzMoGnLiZBk1",
    "head_sha": "2ff2a2b73ba485e70b5cef1fc3233dca043a5755",
